{"id":"n40591-1-7","stage":2,"title":"다지다 · 剁","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40591-1-7-1","ko":"여기 돈가스 정말 맛있다.","zh":"这里的炸猪排真的很好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈가스","meaning":"韩式炸猪排","explanation":"돈가스：韩式炸猪排","readings":[{"term":"돈가스","audio":"/audio/49f71795878caf1df342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48583","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈가스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있다.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"49f71795878caf1d","term":"돈가스","zh":"韩式炸猪排","audio":"/audio/49f71795878caf1df342.mp3","entryId":"48583","definition":"把稍厚的猪肉放入调料腌制后沾上面包粉，再油炸而成的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ebfcbe3be216d02e1ffd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40591-1-7-2","ko":"응, 여기는 고기를 다지는 일부터 모두 요리사가 직접 한대.","zh":"嗯，据说从把肉切成肉末开始，所有步骤都是厨师亲自操作的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词